                "question": "Can AI grade step-by-step math problems?",
                "answer": "Yes. Answer Sheet Evaluation by BigChalkBox supports partial credit logic. Faculty assign weights to specific derivation steps. If a student completes steps 1 and 2 correctly but fails step 3, the AI awards the partial marks and generates feedback explaining the error."
