                "content": "<p>It is crucial to remember that AI cannot replace the pedagogical expertise of a seasoned professor. An AI might generate a perfectly formatted lesson plan, but it lacks the contextual understanding of what a specific classroom of students needs.</p>\n<p>BigChalkBox enforces a strict \"Human-in-the-loop\" philosophy for all generated materials. The AI acts as a highly efficient teaching assistant, handling the heavy lifting of document structuring and basic formatting.</p>\n<p>The human educator must always review the generated lesson plans. They retain the absolute authority to modify learning objectives, inject real-world anecdotes into the slides, and tailor the handouts to their specific teaching style. The human remains the master of the classroom.</p>"
